<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 94 0 R
/T (Finally, we used a Choo Choo mechanism to launch catalysts across the field. This mechanism works by pulling back on bungee sprung rails, and then releasing it once the linkage crosses the center point. New to the design and never done before, is a one-way bearing \(in the pulley at the base of the system\), which ensures that once the linkage goes over the center, it is instantly released, with no external resistance force from the servo.)
/E (Finally, we used a Choo Choo mechanism to launch catalysts across the field. This mechanism works by pulling back on bungee sprung rails, and then releasing it once the linkage crosses the center point. New to the design and never done before, is a one-way bearing \(in the pulley at the base of the system\), which ensures that once the linkage goes over the center, it is instantly released, with no external resistance force from the servo.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
