/Title (After crunching numbers for potential chokehold strategies, running 2v2 matches in DSim, and discussing realistic robot limitations, our team came up with the following strategy that defined our robot design:)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 354 0 R
/Prev 418 0 R
